            <ArticleTitle>Lumbo-sacral spine disease due to bovine tuberculosis in a patient with concurrent pulmonary disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>459-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4104/pcrj.2011.00037</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Lumbo-sacral spinal disease due to bovine tuberculosis (TB) in a patient with concurrent pulmonary disease is rare. We report this unpredicted finding in an immunocompetent patient and discuss the natural history in an area of low prevalence.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
